From a6562f10d063a9097d4ad6d6696e87e7a4a8efdb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Wilderness01 <140787484+Wilderness01@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 00:54:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Ultrawide: Odyssey renders 19.5:9 via camera-aspect widening
 (UW)

Upstream-Status: fork-only
Reason: The 0097 render-wider approach (game display width 1280->1560 handheld, 1600->1950 docked) has two defects: handheld stretches ~22% wider because the camera aspect does not follow the display rectangle, and docked shows a black screen because the swap-chain texture stays 1600x900 while the crop is 1950x900. UW (ultrawide, rewritten from the 3.0 IPA DmIOS binary; no S2Arm source was available) avoids both: the game keeps rendering 1600x900, the camera aspect is temporarily widened to the screen aspect (2.167) while the projection matrix is built (vtable hook, slot 13, with a direct-write fallback when iOS refuses the vtable mprotect), and the present layer stretches the 1600x900 output to fill 2340x1080, so the widen factor (1.219) cancels the stretch factor (1.219) and the picture is wider with correct proportions. New host files dm/host/uw.h + dm/host/uw.c, loader.c registers the main module and calls uw_init, the 0097 wider branch in loader.c and the auto branch in front_ios.m are kept for the present shape, and nvn_mtl.m calls uw_frame_hook every present. Requires game env DM_ASPECT=auto, DM_UW_NOPATCH=1, DM_UW_CAM=0x136f550,0x13540e8, DM_UW_VTSLOT=13, DM_UW_UI=6 (set in the app Documents/env.txt or baked in via --env-file).
Issue: Wilderness01/NX2Apple#1
