-        // takes 1.3 to 1.77), else 16:9. The window's, not the screen's: on an iPad under Stage Manager or Split View the app does not fill the screen. Resolved here, before the
+    {   // Picture shape "auto" (the launcher's Match screen): the app window's own shape when it is taller than 16:9 (an iPad's 4:3, an unfolded iPhone Duo's 1.43:1) or wider (an iPhone's 19.5:9; loader.c
